WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,360
I haven't done it

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,260
I'm not what I said

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,300
Then why are you standing next to the body?

4
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,100
I heard something moving here

5
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,660
Just come and see what's going on

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,940
So tell me what you saw?

7
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,500
What did you see, Brother Lin?

8
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,020
This is not what a great man is

9
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,960
You can't kill someone without absolute evidence. What's your name?

10
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,480
Liu Jialiang

11
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,000
You saw something was wrong

12
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:33,020
Why don't you invite everyone to come with me?

13
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,300
I don't know

14
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:37,070
Current survivors 29

15
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:39,630
Warm reminders from current great people

16
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,430
A great man is a very intelligent creature

17
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:45,010
They like to imitate human behavior. What will Brother Lin do next?

18
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:46,550
How about we find something to eat first?

19
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:48,070
Please be careful

20
00:00:48,590 --> 00:01:00,050
Start looking for food from now on. Everyone is divided into five groups. Five people in each group look after each other and don’t go in alone.
